OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FMark Forrest showcases the best
OL,7,     Fperformances from the UK and
OL,8,     Fbeyond, including a live concert
OL,9,     Ffrom mezzo-soprano Helen Charlston
OL,10,     Fand pianist Sholto Kynoch at
OL,11,     FWigmore Hall.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Stan Tracey
OL,13,     F1/5. Kate Molleson is joined by
OL,14,     FClark Tracey to explore the life
OL,15,     Fand work of his father, pianist
OL,16,     Fand composer Stan Tracey.
OL,17,G1700 In Tune
OL,18,     FPianist Paul Lewis chats to Katie
OL,19,     Fahead of concerts in Bath and
OL,20,     FLondon. Tony nominated singer Ann
OL,21,     FHampton Callaway performs songs by
OL,22,     FCole Porter.
