OL,5,G2145 The Essay: Peggy Seeger - A Life
OL,6,G     in Music
OL,7,     FFrom her front room in
OL,8,     FOxfordshire, Peggy Seeger sits at
OL,9,     Fthe piano and talks Kate Molleson
OL,10,     Fthrough five songs from her
OL,11,     Fseven-decade career, and what it
OL,12,     Ftook to write them.
OL,13,G2200 Night Tracks
OL,14,     FHannah Peel presents an
OL,15,     Fadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,16,     Ffor late-night listening, from
OL,17,     Fclassical to contemporary and
OL,18,     Feverything in between.
